   "children": [
    {
     "blockId": "Q09TTQ",
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        {
         "text": "Even the most battle-hardened editorial team needs a plan of attack. And that plan is called an editorial calendar. It’s a crucial tool for everything from brainstorming blog topics, to setting deadlines and analyzing content performance. Our template saves you time by acting as a single source of truth for your team—so you can focus on creating stellar content."
        }
       ],
       "textId": "tFqcp3",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "data": {},
     "relationId": "NKdOQZ",
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "blockId": "_zSHQz",
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        {
         "text": "​"
        }
       ],
       "textId": "hHoxkc",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "data": {},
     "relationId": "pV7QzS",
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "blockId": "hD5Lxe",
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        {
         "bold": true,
         "text": "Optimize."
        },
        {
         "text": " What’s actually working for your readers? Analyze engagement by tracking feedback and views, so you can tell which topics are a hit."
        }
       ],
       "textId": "KCerps",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "data": {},
     "relationId": "8xGbzF",
     "type": "bulleted_list"
    },
    {
     "blockId": "N7lFWZ",
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        {
         "bold": true,
         "text": "Observe."
        },
        {
         "text": " Missing a deadline is bad, breaking an embargo is worse. With customizable and highly-visible fields, this template ensures everyone can see every story’s dependencies."
        }
       ],
       "textId": "XXEcEB",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "data": {},
     "relationId": "WiGZgY",
     "type": "bulleted_list"
    },
    {
     "blockId": "oEo7Ds",
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        {
         "bold": true,
         "text": "Align."
        },
        {
         "text": " Every piece of content has a writer, a deadline, and a story status. You’ll always know what’s coming down the pike with intuitive filters that showcase whatever information you’re looking for."
        }
       ],
       "textId": "qVNvCr",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
